3.4 TensorTrait
Function Usage
GlobalTensor and LocalTensor use member variables of the ShapeInfo type to
store shape information, which can be set or obtained by using SetShapeInfo and
GetShapeInfo. Generally, the member variables are used to store and transfer
shape information inside operators. If the preceding ShapeInfo functions are not
used, the information is not required. In this case, you can use TensorTrait to
define the GlobalTensor and LocalTensor without ShapeInfo to reduce the
memory usage and improve the running performance.
